# ops/ci/floating-image-pins.allow — image references that carried a tag and no
# digest when ops/ci/check-image-refs-pinned.py landed (2026-09-22). ADR 0703
# says every reference is pinned by digest; these are the known gaps.
#
# This list only SHRINKS. Pin a reference and delete its line; the guard fails
# on a new floating reference AND on a line whose reference is already pinned.
#
# Format: <path> <key>   # note
#   role default -> key is the variable name
#   compose      -> key is the image string
#   Dockerfile   -> key is the FROM image
#
# How to pin one without changing what runs: for a deployed image, read the
# digest the host is RUNNING (`docker inspect <ctr> --format '{{.Image}}'`, or
# the RepoDigest), not whatever the tag resolves to today — a fresh resolve is
# an upgrade. For a Dockerfile base, `crane digest <ref>` pins today's build.
